      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "intro1a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Keeping toilets clean, fresh, and hygienically safe is a daily challenge for anyone operating a restaurant, gas station, or other public facilities. One of the most important - yet often overlooked - details is the urinal screen. These not only eliminate unpleasant odors, but also prevent urine splash back, thereby reducing the spread of urine droplets from the surface of the urinal screen. They make a significant contribution to overall hygiene. But how do you choose the right screen for your toilets?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
